{
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    Filename:       FXOS8700-IntDemo.spin2
    Description:    Demo of the FXOS8700 driver
        * Interrupt functionality
    Author:         Jesse Burt
    Started:        Sep 26, 2020
